Package: aurora-camera-denoise
Architecture: arm64
Depends: pipewire, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: denoising filter for the built-in camera (Aurora)
 aurora-camera-denoise is a PipeWire filter that denoises the built-in camera
 of Apple silicon laptops, as macOS filters it. It uses the video encoder's
 temporal filter where the kernel has it, a Neural Engine low-light stage, or
 a built-in CPU backend. The user service runs for every desktop user; a user
 turns it off in denoise.conf or with "systemctl --user mask".
